[0.3, "o", "\u001b[38;5;246m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;231m/context-guru:save-more\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[49m  \u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[49m shell command \u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m● \u001b[39mUser answered Claude's questions:\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  · Apply both recommended changes?\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mRecommended: preset conservative -> medium (takes effect now). Why: highest net on your own sessions, \u001b[39m\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mafter its own model spend.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mRecommended: cache strategy 5-min-ping -> adaptive (takes effect at the next proxy restart). Why: it had\r\n\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;246mthe highest net on your own sessions.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mWhich would you like to apply? → Apply both\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m3\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[49m shell commands \u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[39m Done — both recommended changes applied. Undo with:\r\n  - /context-guru:save-more revert config\r\n  - /context-guru:save-more revert cache\r\n\r\n  What would you like to do next?\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mBrewed for 38s · done 10:49 PM\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                                                                                            \u001b[38;5;246m● high · /effort\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\u001b[39m❯ \u001b[7m \u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;246m⏸ manual mode on · ? for shortcuts · ← for agents\u001b[39m\r\n"]
